 "notes": "SWP Mem II p. 392 (Khurbet Fusail, linked in Stage 1b) is not the unit; it describes ruins spread 2.5 miles N-S, probably the Kh. Fasayil of S1579/E200 (922 m), so it is within 2 km; its tanks (along a 5.5-mile aqueduct) and line of pits have no point or direction from the unit and are coded position none. Ossuary fragment (S1579/E200) is a find, not coded as a grave. E200 repeats S1579's component list; both coded. Beduin tombs coded L (attribution to Bedouin taken as a late date); this is a judgement."
